# SECTION D: CONSOLIDATED EVIDENCE-BASED INTERVENTIONS

This section details the concrete, actionable intervention specifications for the Top 10 Shortlisted Priorities.

```
Resource Tier Definitions:
• Low Resource: <£50k per site; workflow/protocol modification, existing software reconfiguration, internal staff reallocation.
• Medium Resource: £50k–£250k per site; specialized software licensing, targeted staffing procurement, point-of-care device rollouts.
• High Resource: >£250k per site; major estate reconfiguration, capital hardware acquisition, large-scale clinical establishments.
```

